{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synth Laser is a rail-based dynamic laser maze rhythm game. Get ready to dodge and weave around the deadly and stunning laser show, built upon the outrun and synthwave music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game provides a breathtaking laser show with the precision of rhythm games. Players must dodge the zapping lasers, timing each movement to the beat of a mesmerizing synthwave soundtrack, creating a uniquely immersive flow state. Developed by solo indie creator Sarah Noor, the game blends razor-sharp gameplay with a stunning outrun aesthetic, offering a fresh take on the rhythm-action genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out first few levels for free!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Watch a Music-based Laser show</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Experience Synthwave style graphics and music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dodge and weave through the deadly lasers of the laser show</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rotate the level and move side to side to dodge the lasers</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022160?t=1758308486","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022160?t=1758308486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022160/66cc042e0c84a9d07de5f8cb72e7485b522a0a4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758308486","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022160/66cc042e0c84a9d07de5f8cb72e7485b522a0a4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758308486","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synth Laser is a rail-based dynamic laser maze rhyth